{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. PROMOTES MALLIKA MONTEIRO TO EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF GROWTH & STRATEGY OFFICER', 'text': "CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT MALLIKA MONTEIRO HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF GROWTH & STRATEGY OFFICER. AS PART OF HER EXPANDED RESPONSIBILITIES, MONTEIRO WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR CONSUMER AND CATEGORY INSIGHTS, INNOVATION AND NEW PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT ACROSS BEER, WINE AND SPIRITS, AS WELL AS THE COMPANY’S STRATEGY DEVELOPMENT AND BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION FUNCTIONS. MONTEIRO WILL ALSO SERVE AS A MEMBER OF COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE. MONTEIRO JOINED CONSTELLATION BRANDS IN 2016 AS VICE PRESIDENT, BEER INNOVATION, WHERE SHE HELPED STRENGTHEN THE COMPANY’S INNOVATION PROCESS, CONTRIBUTING TO ONE OF CONSTELLATION’S MOST SUCCESSFUL NEW PRODUCT LAUNCHES IN CORONA PREMIER. MONTEIRO WAS PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF GROWTH OFFICER IN OCTOBER 2018, WHERE SHE LED THE DEVELOPMENT AND LAUNCH OF A NUMBER OF NEW PRODUCT INTRODUCTIONS ACROSS BEER, WINE AND SPIRITS, INCLUDING CORONA REFRESCA, ROBERT MONDAVI PRIVATE SELECTION BOURBON BARREL AGED WINES, AND SVEDKA ROSÉ. MONTEIRO ALSO SERVED AS CHIEF OF STAFF TO THE COMPANY’S EXECUTIVE MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE AND WAS A DRIVING FORCE BEHIND THE COMPANY’S FOCUS ON FEMALE FOUNDERS PROGRAM, DESIGNED TO INVEST $100 MILLION IN FEMALE-FOUNDED OR FEMALE-OWNED START-UPS IN THE BEVERAGE ALCOHOL SPACE BY 2028."}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-03 13:30:00', 'title': "CONSTELLATION BRANDS EXECUTIVE - CANOPY GROWTH'S FINANCIAL RESULTS WILL LIKELY BE VOLATILE AS THEY CONTINUE TO FOCUS ON PROFITABILITY", 'text': 'EXEC - MODELO ESPECIAL GENERATED THE MOST DOLLAR SALES GROWTH IN THE ENTIRE U.S. BEER CATEGORY DURING Q2 - CONF CALL.EXEC - "CONSTELLATION & GALLO ARE WORKING IN FULL COOPERATION WITH FTC, WHILE THEY CONTINUE TO REVIEW OUR WINE AND SPIRITS DEAL".EXEC - WE\'RE PLEASED WITH THE PROGRESS OF THE CANOPY TEAM AND WHAT THEY HAVE DONE IN THE LAST FEW MONTHS.EXEC - CANOPY\'S BUSINESS IS RAPIDLY EVOLVING & THEIR FINANCIAL RESULTS WILL LIKELY BE VOLATILE AS THEY CONTINUE TO FOCUS ON THEIR PATHS TO PROFITABILITY.EXEC SAYS NEW HARD SELTZER TO BE INTRODUCED IN FOUR FLAVORS & WILL CONTAIN 90 CALORIES, 0 CARBS AND 0 SUGARS.'}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-03 09:30:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS QTRLY REPORTED LOSS PER SHARE $2.77', 'text': 'QTRLY REPORTED LOSS PER SHARE $2.77.QTRLY COMPARABLE EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.72.SEES 2020 EPS ON A REPORTED BASIS $0.55 - $0.75.QTRLY REPORTED NET SALES $2.34 BILLION, UP 2%.SEES, ON COMPARABLE BASIS, FY20 EPS OF $9.00 - $9.20.CONSTELLATION BRANDS - SEES NET SALES AND OPERATING INCOME GROWTH FROM BEER AT 7% - 9%  FOR 2020.SEES FY20 WINE AND SPIRITS NET SALES DECLINE 15 - 20%.CONSTELLATION BRANDS - SEES 2020 CAPEX $800 MILLION - $900 MILLION.INCREASES FISCAL 2020 OPERATING CASH FLOW TARGET TO ABOUT $2.2 BILLION AND FREE CASH FLOW PROJECTION TO $1.3 BILLION - $1.4 BILLION.WINE AND SPIRITS TRANSACTION NOW EXPECTED TO CLOSE BY YEAR END FISCAL 2020.CONSTELLATION BRANDS - SEES 2020 FCF $1.3 BILLION - $1.4 BILLION.CONSTELLATION’S SHARE OF CANOPY GROWTH’S EQUITY LOSSES AND RELATED ACTIVITIES FOR Q2 TOTALED A LOSS OF $484.4 MILLION.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.60, REVENUE VIEW $2.34 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q2 REVENUE VIEW $2.34 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.CONSTELLATION BRANDS - IN Q2, RECORDED $46 MILLION OF CHARGES RELATED TO EFFORTS TO GAIN EFFICIENCIES AND REDUCE COST STRUCTURE OF BUSINESS.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $8.43 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.CONSTELLATION BRANDS - DUE TO WINE AND SPIRITS AND BLACK VELVET DEALS, COST REDUCTION PLAN IS EXPECTED TO BE IMPLEMENTED FOR FISCAL 2020 AND 2021.'}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. PROMOTES MALLIKA MONTEIRO TO EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF GROWTH & STRATEGY OFFICER', 'text': "CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT MALLIK